# Glint-Web Rules

Use this editor to turn real screenshots into polished store assets.

## Must keep

1. Left sidebar: templates/assets/export only
2. Right sidebar: design properties only
3. Device frames must fill screenshot insets without gaps
4. No-frame mode supports rounded corners + stroke
5. Export sizes stay store-correct (Play/iOS/iPad presets)
6. ZIP file naming: `{appName}.zip` when app name exists, else `glint.zip`

## Assets behavior

- Session import reads `session.json` and maps ordered `screens` to PNG files
- Canvas assets panel must allow:
  - selecting assets
  - move forward/back one level
  - bring to front / send to back
